OL,5,G2200 Call the Bailiffs: Time to...
OL,6,     F...Pay Up! Agents pursue a company
OL,7,     Fordered to repay money unlawfully
OL,8,     Fdeducted from a former employee's
OL,9,     Fwages. When the director refuses
OL,10,     Fto pay, they consider seizing
OL,11,     Fcompany assets.
OL,12,G2300 Skin A&E
OL,13,     FDr Adil Sheraz removes a giant
OL,14,     Flipoma from a patient's back,
OL,15,     Fwhile Dr Toby Nelson tackles 13
OL,16,     Flipomas on a single patient, and
OL,17,     Fthere's a nasty face cyst for Dr
OL,18,     FEmma McMullen.
